first quarter.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Production was lost in April due to geopolitical conflict and sudden component availability issues.","quote":"If you recollect in the month of April, there was a loss of production due to certain challenges because of this war situation and sudden availability of supplier parts.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":16.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects international market growth in Q2 to match or slightly exceed the pace seen in Q1.","quote":"On international market, we are expecting the same growth rate to continue or slightly better growth rate. And we are also investing behind capacity.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Management anticipates the industry will deliver double-digit growth for the full year.","quote":"So overall, as a year, we should estimate an industry growth of double digit.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Two-wheeler demand was driven by semi-urban and rural demand, wedding season purchases, and electric vehicle adoption.","quote":"The 2-wheeler category witnessed strong demand due to steady semi-urban and rural participation and Marriage Season buying alone and along with increase in electric vehicle growth.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"The company implemented a 1.5% price increase in the first quarter and planned an additional 0.5% hike in the second quarter.","quote":"Even if you increase prices, it will take time to come back. So that's why we said we have taken about 1.5% in the first quarter. progressively, we have looked at in Q2 also 0.5%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Commodity costs increased by about 3.5% in Q1 with an additional 0.5% expected in Q2, leading to an overall impact of roughly 4%.","quote":"Commodity cost, I think, is about 3.5% and maybe another 0.5% this quarter because there is a quarterly adjustments. So overall, you can take about 3.5% or 0.5%, so about 4%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Management expects product mix improvements, scale benefits, and active cost reduction efforts to support EBITDA margin expansion.","quote":"So, I'm pretty confident that a combination of the product mix plus the growth and scale benefit and cost reduction. We have a very strong cost reduction team, is going to help us in EBITDA journey.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"TVS is investing around INR 3,500 crores in capacity expansion and new product development.","quote":"So this is a big, big increase, and that's why we are also investing somewhere around, including our new products, we are investing about INR 3,500 crores, new products plus all the capacity expansion","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The company is expanding its annual two-wheeler capacity from 6.8 million to 8.3 million units and three-wheeler capacity from 0.25 million to 0.42 million units.","quote":"I think last time I highlighted, we are going for 8.3 million from the current capacity of about 6.8 million. And in 3-wheeler, we are going from 0.25 million capacity to about 0.42 million.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"The company's long-term facility credit rating was upgraded from CARE AA+ to AAA.","quote":"We're also proud to announce that recently, our long-term facility credit rating has been upgraded from CARE AA+ to AAA.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"TVS Motor commenced production and European shipments of the first Norton Atlas models from its Hosur manufacturing plant.","quote":"Norton motorcycles have marked the rollout of first Atlas models at TVS Motor Company's Hosur manufacturing facility in June, and it has started moving into Europe","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"Two-wheeler electric vehicle penetration surpassed 10.6% in the month of June.","quote":"The EV side, I think we would have seen in Q1, the penetration in the month of June alone, if you look at it is over 10.6%, which is a big change.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"Management flagged risks related to monsoon progression and elevated food and energy prices despite healthy demand.","quote":"While there are challenges on monsoon progression and some elevation in terms of the food and energy prices, the demand looks very, very strong.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"Overall, the outlook remains very, very strong. We are looking at -- While there are challenges on monsoon progression and some elevation in terms of the food and energy prices, the demand looks very, very strong.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[{"kpi":"Sales volume (units)","value":1.63,"unit":"million units","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":3},{"kpi":"Volume growth YoY %","value":28.0,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":3},{"kpi":"EBITDA margin %","value":12.8,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28072026141905_NSEBSEAnalystcallTranscript_sd.pdf","page":4}]}},{"q":"FY27Q2","ql":"Q2 FY27","basis":"consolidated","rev":19474.4,"ebitda":2725.5,"pat":1194.5,"eps":25.14,"m":14.0,"m_y":-111.0,"rev_y":38.6,"rev_q":19.5,"ebitda_y":28.4,"pat_y":50.2,"pat_q":17.2,"label":"Good","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/INTEGRATED_FILING_INDAS_1748258_28102026082728_WEB.xml","ev":{"ts":"2026-10-28T15:01:47","src":"NSE announcement","day":3.7},"docs":[{"k":"result","t":"Outcome of Board Meeting","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TVSMOTOR_28102026145